    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9967" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντικαθίζομαι</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντικατ-</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-εδοῦμαι</span>: aor.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-εζόμην</span>:—
			Med.
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sit</i> or <i>lie
				over against,</i> of armies or fleets watching one another,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.3.5.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.30
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				4.124
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>place</i> or <i>settle instead of</i> another,
				<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>4 Ki.</u>
				17.26
			</span></i>.</div>
